   "location": "Data points, 2005-2014",
   "fact": "Each point has a numeric label above it: 23.9 (2005), 23.9 (2006), 21.4 (2007), 20.0 (2008), 17.9 (2009), 15.5 (2010), 15.3 (2011), 13.8 (2012), 11.3 (2013), 10.1 (2014). The line is flat between 2005-2006 and declines thereafter, with the steepest visible drop between 2012 and 2013."
