  {
   "location": "Y-axis scale",
   "fact": "Axis runs from 0 at the bottom to a top tick near 20, with labeled ticks at 0, 5, 10, 15, 20. The 2005/2006 points sit visibly above the 20 tick; the 2014 point sits just above the 10 tick."
  },
  {
   "location": "Full-period extent",
   "fact": "The series begins at the highest labeled value (23.9) in 2005 and ends at the lowest labeled value (10.1) in 2014, a net drop of roughly 13.8 index points, about 58% of the starting value."
  }
